									<font color=white size=5><b>BERTOX Slain!!  3 Attempts later and he falls to a flawless 54 man!</b></font><BR>
		                    	    <BR>
									<font color=white>
									Well we really took the place apart this day.  We had 54 Clan Dread.  We smashed down all the kings near flawlessly to find outrselves 1 hour into the script (or 1 hour left depending on how you see it) and we spawned Bertox.  We gathered our troops and moved out and prepared for inc!<BR><BR>We smoked him down in good speed - retaining every single member of the raid.  It was clean - it was beutiful.  Great timing and skill. <BR><BR>Only MM now stands between us and the first EoD to enter Sol Ro Tower!<BR><img src="http://pdm-works.mmaweb.net/WebMain/UniImgDir/Guild_1/gsite/UI00000795.JPG"><BR><img src="http://pdm-works.mmaweb.net/WebMain/UniImgDir/Guild_1/gsite/UI00000796.JPG"><BR>
